        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R4-BT, 4\" x 4\" x 1/4\" Radius Residential Steel  Hinge, Zigzag Holes with Ball Tips</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDecorative ball tips are removable - female threaded onto each end of the steel hinge pin. Utilizes Non-template ZigZag screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R4-BT-specifications.gif?v=1704354567\" width=\"557\" height=\"302\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44R4-BT Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch x 1/4 Radius Steel Hinge with Ball Tip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>ZigZag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Tips: Ball Tips</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin:  Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R4-BT-specifications.pdf?v=1704262168\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R4-BT Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
